{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o034","title":"司马朗还乡里，劝父老举宗东到黎阳依托赵威孙营兵","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-051d15794d46844be60d","label":"正文","text":"司马朗还乡里，劝父老举宗东到黎阳依托赵威孙营兵","evidence":["liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a"]},{"id":"liusima-a-7dedc29c46f90833b671","label":"正文","text":"司马朗举家东往黎阳，惟同县赵咨携家属同行","evidence":["liusima-q-7520acf2e4a71c977854"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0024","role":"还乡里后向父老陈说董卓悖逆、义兵必停于郡境之战乱形势，劝举宗东到黎阳，徐复观望；父老莫从之际举家东往","evidence":["liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a","liusima-q-7520acf2e4a71c977854"]},{"person":"liusima-p0058","role":"同县，将家属与朗俱往","evidence":["liusima-q-7520acf2e4a71c977854"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a","liusima-q-7520acf2e4a71c977854"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a","source_order":[15,58,30],"order":3254}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0058","name":"赵咨（字君初）","evidence":["liusima-q-7520acf2e4a71c977854","liusima-q-308b2ae7ff0892a71d21","liusima-q-bb30add53b7672017fe4"],"facts":[{"id":"liusima-f2-216f94996666f8d72d06","text":"官至太常。","evidence":["liusima-q-308b2ae7ff0892a71d21"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-ad72e48e57b1d5690a05","text":"裴注据《百官名》记字君初；子酆字〔仲〕子，为晋骠骑将军，封东平陵公。","evidence":["liusima-q-bb30add53b7672017fe4"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-308b2ae7ff0892a71d21","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-17363620cf9ade2e5f66","layer":"original","quote":"初朗所与俱徙赵咨，官至太常，为世好士。﹝四﹞","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":79,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3a2ad656b0ce7d58bacd","layer":"original","quote":"到，谓父老曰：“董卓悖逆，为天下所仇，此忠臣义士奋发之时也。郡与京都，境壤相接；洛东有成皋，北界大河；天下兴义兵者若未得进，其势必停于此。此乃四分五裂战争之地，难以自安。不如及道路尚通，举宗东到黎阳。黎阳有营兵〖8〗，赵威孙，乡里旧婚，为监营谒者〖9〗，统兵马，足以为主。若后有变，徐复观望，未晚也","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":30,"end":179},{"id":"liusima-q-7520acf2e4a71c977854","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-511f012c14f14dff5c5b","layer":"original","quote":"父老恋旧，莫有从者；惟同县赵咨，将家属俱与朗往焉","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"liusima-q-bb30add53b7672017fe4","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-4b002abdae38ce0da4ed","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞咨字君初。子酆，字〔仲〕子，晋骠骑将军，封东平陵公。并见《百官名》（志）。","attribution":"裴注（引书见引句）","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3a90875aaa4d084a66f5","start":0,"end":40}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
